DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     Convert a contiguous string name to internal form.  In general, the in‐
     ternal name returned (via the _o_u_t_p_u_t___n_a_m_e parameter) will not be an MN;
     the exception to this is if the _i_n_p_u_t___n_a_m_e___t_y_p_e indicates that the con‐
     tiguous string provided via the _i_n_p_u_t___n_a_m_e___b_u_f_f_e_r parameter is of type
     GSS_C_NT_EXPORT_NAME, in which case the returned internal name will be an
     MN for the mechanism that exported the name.

