     minor_status       Mechanism specific status code.

     input_name_buffer  Buffer containing contiguous string name to convert.

     input_name_type    Object ID specifying type of printable name.  Applica‐
                        tions may specify either GSS_C_NO_OID to use a mecha‐
                        nism-specific default printable syntax, or an OID rec‐
                        ognized by the GSS-API implementation to name a spe‐
                        cific namespace.

     output_name        Returned name in internal form.  Storage associated
                        with this name must be freed by the application after
                        use with a call to ggssss__rreelleeaassee__nnaammee().

